                        BBS_Stats History File
===========================================================================

=== v2.1 ===

    - A small modification was made to correctly read Ken's new way of
      storing the GENDER of each user, from the M/F format to the newer
      0/1 format.

    - A special utility: "Gender_Checker" was included with this version
      to check your "bbs.udata" file and report all accounts that had bad
      GENDER information stored in them.

=== v2.0 ===

    - This version incorporated intelligent Computer Types knowledge. No
      matter how you have your Computer Types configured, this version was
      written to handle them.

    - Modifications were made to the format of the printed screen, in case
      the SysOp had more than 15 computer types.

=== v1.0 ===

    - First publically released version.
    - Created one 80-column screen, using default computer types.

